  "title": "Cardamom and Espresso Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "Add some zing to your chocolate chip cookies with a bit of espresso and cardamom flavor! These are somewhat thin and chewy cookie,s which makes them perfect for dunking into your morning cup of coffee.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim"
